        "answer": {
          "short": "$2x+11$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}(x+6)^2-(x+5)^2&=x^2+12x+36-(x^2+10x+25)\\\\(x+6)^2-(x+5)^2&=x^2+12x+36-x^2-10x-25\\\\(x+6)^2-(x+5)^2&=2x+11\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
